In our results, we implement a variety of real-world graphics and vision applications. Their energy functions are expressible in tens of lines of code, and produce highly-optimized GPU solver implementations. These solvers are competitive in performance with the best published hand-tuned, application-specic GPU solvers, and orders of magnitude beyond a generalpurpose auto-generated solver.
